  "body": "<!-- cliproxyapi-linux-release-assets:start -->\n## Linux release assets\n\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_linux_<arch>.tar.gz` is the default Linux build. It supports dynamic library plugins and is built against a GLIBC 2.17 baseline.\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_linux_<arch>_no-plugin.tar.gz` is the portable Linux build for musl-based or older systems such as OpenWrt. It does not support dynamic library plugins.\n\n## FreeBSD release assets\n\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_freebsd_aarch64_no-plugin.tar.gz` is the FreeBSD arm64 build. It is built without CGO and does not support dynamic library plugins.\n\n<!-- cliproxyapi-linux-release-assets:end -->\n\n## Changelog\n\n- fix(openai): process reasoning deltas before content in responses stream (c8ecb4f3)\n- fix(antigravity): keep active block open on empty text parts in claude stream (fd3e6623)\n- fix(auth): treat cloudflare 520-526 origin errors as transient upstream failures (9fad5055)\n- fix(gemini): preserve function call pairing for interrupted calls and replay failures (b8e6ec0a)\n- fix(auth): bound force refresh all concurrency using worker pool (6dce7867)\n- fix(translator): ignore fco output item IDs when extracting responses call ID (5a07045e)\n- feat(usage): propagate upstream base_url across usage records and plugin auth (c8f723e0)\n- chore(codex): update codex user-agent to 0.154.0 (8461b4e9)\n- fix(codex): inherit template metadata for model aliases and restrict provider capabilities (8f23ad02)\n- fix(translator): support incomplete status and response.incomplete event in responses translation (4efcac79)\n- feat(auth): support execution result policy before quota and cooldown mutations (2912516c)\n- fix(translator): relay claude tool result images as user messages for openai (4cd17293)\n- feat(auth): support organization-hashed claude credentials and legacy migration (fc96a87f)\n- fix(translator): preserve unknown thinking signatures in claude to codex compat translation (942bda99)\n- fix(translator): support audio transcription parts in gemini response translation (5c80a01c)\n- fix(auth): drop stale auth updates using monotonic watcher revisions (d1702fdf)\n- fix(signature): preserve Gemini 3 server-side tool thought signatures (#5652) (54776fb3)\n- fix(thinking): extract configuration_update reasoning effort in codex usage reporting (4edf9d1d)\n- feat(signature): validate Claude CAQS reasoning signatures (75ce6352)\n- fix(claude): anchor billing fingerprint to initial turn for cloaked cache stability (377c315f)\n- feat(kimi): add Kimi K2.8 model definitions, normalization, and temperature guard (8bd67f33)\n- feat(readme): add RapidProxy sponsorship details and logo (e88cd947)\n- feat(readme): add RapidProxy sponsorship details and logo in Chinese and Japanese (ae8f1f8b)\n- fix(gemini): include thought tokens in OpenAI completion usage (cd1e8e10)\n- fix(gemini): include thought tokens in OpenAI responses usage (c2562d8a)\n- fix(websockets): prevent keepalive pong starvation during large payload writes (b5ba02c2)\n- Merge pull request #5744 from smartconnect365/fix/5733 (9781fe46)\n- Merge pull request #5746 from smartconnect365/fix/gemini-responses-output-tokens (137db720)\n- fix(auth): clear unauthorized cooldowns on credential changes and sync codex plan type (456d4c37)\n- fix(claude): forward unmanaged caller betas on direct anthropic requests (d9b8fdb7)\n- feat(plugins): expose model list responses to plugin interceptors (5b278561)\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(signature): preserve Gemini 3 server-side tool thought signatures (#5652) by @sususu98 in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/5731\n* feat(signature): validate Claude CAQS reasoning signatures by @sususu98 in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/5732\n* fix(gemini): include thought tokens in OpenAI completion usage by @smartconnect365 in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/5744\n* fix(gemini): include thought tokens in OpenAI responses usage by @smartconnect365 in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/5746\n\n## New Contributors\n* @smartconnect365 made their first contribution in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/5744\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/compare/v7.2.157...v7.2.158\n",
